      "content": "i know there are people to call, but that doesn't change the reality of it. it's just a bandaid. it doesn't fix the fact that i'm fundamentally broken, and i'm just passing that brokenness down to anyone who gets close to me. it feels less like a crisis and more like a logical conclusion. if the pattern is actually inescapable, wouldn't the most responsible thing be to just prevent the next chapter from even being written?",
